What is Currency Sorter?
A currency sorter is an integrated cash‑handling solution that automates the identification, verification, counting and organization of banknotes and coins. By leveraging multi‑modal sensors-ultraviolet, infrared, magnetic and high‑resolution imaging-these devices can detect counterfeit notes, assess fitness, and sort denominations into precise strands for downstream processes such as ATM loading or vault storage. The technology not only accelerates cash processing but also generates granular audit trails that satisfy AML and other regulatory requirements, thereby reducing the risk of compliance breaches.
